      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Heard Mr. HRA Choudhury, learned Senior Counsel for the petitioner assisted by learned counsel Mr. A.M. Ahmed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 514,
      "end": 624,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "HRA Choudhury",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 524,
          "end": 537
        },
        {
          "text": "A.M. Ahmed",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 613,
          "end": 623
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Also heard Mr. P.S. Lahkar, learned Addl. P.P. for the State.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 625,
      "end": 686,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "P.S. Lahkar",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 640,
          "end": 651
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "2. The petitioner Abed Ali has filed an application under Section 438 Cr.PC with prayer for Page No.# 2/3 pre-arrest bail as he is apprehending arrest in connection with Abhayapuri P.S. Case No.\n528/2022 under Sections 468/471/420/409 IPC.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 688,
      "end": 927,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Abed Ali",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 706,
          "end": 714
        },
        {
          "text": "Section 438",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 746,
          "end": 757
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.PC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 758,
          "end": 763
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhayapuri P.S.",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 858,
          "end": 873
        },
        {
          "text": "Case No.\n528/2022",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 874,
          "end": 891
        },
        {
          "text": "Sections 468/471/420/409",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 898,
          "end": 922
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 923,
          "end": 926
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16567079722881317
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "Abed Ali vs The State Of Assam on 22 March, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/66704600/\n1 3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 928,
      "end": 1036,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Abed Ali vs The State Of Assam",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 929,
          "end": 959
        },
        {
          "text": "22 March, 2023 Indian Kanoon",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 963,
          "end": 991
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "It is submitted that the petitioner's earlier bail petition under Section 438 Cr.PC was rejected vide order dated 23.01.2023 in Case No. AB 3840/2022.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1037,
      "end": 1187,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 438",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1103,
          "end": 1114
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.PC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1115,
          "end": 1120
        },
        {
          "text": "23.01.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1151,
          "end": 1161
        },
        {
          "text": "Case No. AB 3840/2022",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1165,
          "end": 1186
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2130144089460373
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The petitioner has preferred this petition with a new ground.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1188,
      "end": 1249,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11344296485185623
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "It is submitted that the actual facts of the case is that there are 700/800 students of C.K. College, Chakla.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1250,
      "end": 1359,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "C.K. College, Chakla",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1338,
          "end": 1358
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13555312156677246
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "There are two streams in the college i.e. Arts and Commerce.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1360,
      "end": 1420,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15355777740478516
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "Mr. Sahidul Islam is the Principal while his brother Abdul Maleque, was working as UDA in the same college.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1421,
      "end": 1528,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sahidul Islam",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1425,
          "end": 1438
        },
        {
          "text": "Abdul Maleque",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1474,
          "end": 1487
        },
        {
          "text": "UDA",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1504,
          "end": 1507
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.184379443526268
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "The present petitioner is also a Grade-IV employee in the same College.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1529,
      "end": 1601,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19761508703231812
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "The Principal of the College in connivance with his own brother Abdul Maleque, brother-in-law Ziaul Hoque and his aunt Farida Khatun have siphoned off the money meant for scholarship under the Ishan Uday Scheme.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1602,
      "end": 1813,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Abdul Maleque",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1666,
          "end": 1679
        },
        {
          "text": "Ziaul Hoque",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1696,
          "end": 1707
        },
        {
          "text": "Farida Khatun",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1721,
          "end": 1734
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishan Uday Scheme",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1795,
          "end": 1812
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2585374116897583
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "The present petitioner was not named in the FIR but he has been become a victim of circumstances due to the misdeeds of the Principal and his family members.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1814,
      "end": 1971,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28226444125175476
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "It is submitted that through his entire service the petitioner was not allotted or assigned with any work or responsibility relating to the scholarship under the Ishan Uday Scheme.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1972,
      "end": 2152,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ishan Uday Scheme",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2134,
          "end": 2151
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2872665226459503
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "The petitioner had assigned the work of scholarship to the UDA and three other Junior Assistants who are related to the Principal of the C.K. College.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2153,
      "end": 2303,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "UDA",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2212,
          "end": 2215
        },
        {
          "text": "C.K. College",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2290,
          "end": 2302
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.31054258346557617
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "4. I have considered the submissions at the Bar with circumspection.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2304,
      "end": 2373,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "The FIR unfolds that rampant ongoing corruption was detected under the Scheme of Ishan Uday Scholarship.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2374,
      "end": 2478,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ishan Uday Scholarship",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2455,
          "end": 2477
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2577362060546875
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "Several colleges tried to siphon off funds granted as scholarship by submitting lists of fake students.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2479,
      "end": 2582,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24559569358825684
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "These lists were verified by the authorities in the college in a clandestine manner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2583,
      "end": 2667,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2534194588661194
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "The Barpeta SP was apprised about such activities in the colleges.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2668,
      "end": 2734,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20160751044750214
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "An investigation commenced in Barpeta and the Assam Police was also informed about the corrupt practices in C.K. College at Chakla.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2735,
      "end": 2866,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Barpeta",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2765,
          "end": 2772
        },
        {
          "text": "Assam Police",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2781,
          "end": 2793
        },
        {
          "text": "C.K. College at Chakla",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2843,
          "end": 2865
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21989497542381287
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "5. It is also submitted on behalf of the petitioner that he is the sole bread winner of the family.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2868,
      "end": 2967,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15423786640167236
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "He is in no way connected with the anomalies in the Ishan Uday Scholarship.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2968,
      "end": 3043,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ishan Uday",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3020,
          "end": 3030
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22429178655147552
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "The informant is a third party.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3044,
      "end": 3075,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2882324457168579
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "6. The learned Addl. P.P. has raised serious objection stating that there are incriminating materials in the Case Diary against the present petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3077,
      "end": 3228,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1638631522655487
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "It is submitted that the witnesses have stated under Section 161 Cr.P.C. that the petitioner is complicit.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3229,
      "end": 3335,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 161",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 3282,
          "end": 3293
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 3294,
          "end": 3301
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1563892662525177
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "He was handling the Page No.# 3/3 OTP along with Abdul Maleque through which the online proceedings were processed for obtaining the benefit of this scholarship.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3336,
      "end": 3497,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Abdul Maleque",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3385,
          "end": 3398
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23456420004367828
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "The students who are eligible for the scholarship has to score above 80% and not a single student of C.K. College, Chakla has secured above 70%.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3498,
      "end": 3642,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "C.K. College, Chakla",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 3599,
          "end": 3619
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20360422134399414
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "7. There are indeed cogent materials in the Case Diary against the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3644,
      "end": 3722,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24016176164150238
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "It is true that his name is not in the FIR lodged by Dal Pathak.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3723,
      "end": 3787,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Dal Pathak",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3776,
          "end": 3786
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.29142144322395325
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "The petitioner is booked under a serious offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3788,
      "end": 3837,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4421915113925934
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "This is an offence against the Society at large.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3838,
      "end": 3886,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6502000689506531
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "The gravity of the offence is such that the bail petition has to be considered with circumspection.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3887,
      "end": 3986,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.651253342628479
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "The provision under Section 438 Cr.PC cannot be exercised in an untrammelled manner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3987,
      "end": 4071,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 438",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 4007,
          "end": 4018
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.PC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 4019,
          "end": 4024
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6747767329216003
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "The concern of the prosecution as well as the concern of the petitioner has to be taken into consideration and a balance has to be struck.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 4072,
      "end": 4210,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6259272694587708
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 41,
      "text": "It appears that investigation may be adversely affected if the petitioner is insulated from investigation by an order of anticipatory bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 4211,
      "end": 4350,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5045505166053772
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 42,
      "text": "There appears to be no prima facie case to grant pre-arrest bail to the petitioner at this stage of investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 4351,
      "end": 4466,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4937501549720764
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 43,
      "text": "8. In view of my foregoing discussions and considering all aspects, petition is rejected at this stage of investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 4467,
      "end": 4588,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.06532236933708191
    },
    {
